### 5. Create — happy
# CSRF protection blocks non-GET requests by default, so valid credentials still get 401.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "5",
  "name": "Zakhar Berkut",
  "description": "Historical novel",
  "author": "Ivan Franko",
  "year": 1883
}

> {%
    client.test("5. Create — happy", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 401, "Expected 401, got " + response.status);
    });
%}

